---
layout: base.njk
title: About us
description: Who we are, our vision and mission, what we do, and who we serve across the Wassa Amenfi East Municipality.
permalink: /about/index.html
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; About</p>
    <h1>A foundation named for a standard.</h1>
    <p>Obaatanpa means the Good Mother. She provides, she protects, and she does not count the cost. We took the name so that anyone could hold us to it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
      <h2>On this page</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#who">Who we are</a></li>
        <li><a href="#vision">Vision and mission</a></li>
        <li><a href="#values">Our values</a></li>
        <li><a href="#objectives">Aims and objectives</a></li>
        <li><a href="#serve">Who we serve</a></li>
        <li><a href="#where">Where we work</a></li>
        <li><a href="#accountability">Accountability</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2 id="who">Who we are</h2>
      <p>{{ about.whoWeAre }}</p>

      <h2 id="vision">Vision and mission</h2>
      <p><strong>Our vision.</strong> {{ about.vision }}</p>
      <p><strong>Our mission.</strong> {{ about.mission }}</p>

      <h2 id="why">Why this work is needed</h2>
      <p>{{ about.problem }}</p>
      <p>{{ about.promise }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-light" id="values">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>What we stand on.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Five values. We would rather be held to these than to a slogan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principles">
      {% for v in about.values %}
      <div>
        <h3>{{ v.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ v.body }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="programmes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>What we do.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Four areas of work across the Wassa Amenfi East Municipality, each chosen because someone in the community asked for it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prog">
      {% for p in home.programmes %}
      <article>
        <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.body }}</p>
        {% if p.metaLabel %}<dl><dt>{{ p.metaLabel }}</dt><dd>{{ p.metaValue }}</dd></dl>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-light" id="objectives">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Aims and objectives.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Our aim: to empower women and the girl child to thrive in an inclusive society in the Wassa Amenfi East Municipality. These are the six objectives that follow from it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      {% for o in about.objectives %}
      <li><p style="margin:0">{{ o }}</p></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>

    <div class="notice" style="margin-top:2.5rem;max-width:70ch">
      <p><strong>Our five-year goal.</strong> {{ about.goal }}</p>
      <p><strong>Who we aim to reach:</strong> {{ about.target }} That is a target we have set ourselves, not a figure we have already reached &mdash; we will report progress against it here.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="serve">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Who we serve.</h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ about.whoWeServe }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-light" id="where">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Where we work.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The Wassa Amenfi East Municipality, in the Western Region of Ghana.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="where">
      <div>
        <h3>Wassa Akropong</h3>
        <p>Our base. Outreach to elders and persons with disabilities, and support to the Wassa Akropong Government Hospital.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Schools across the municipality</h3>
        <p>Mentorship and health sessions for adolescent girls and boys, most recently at Amenfiman Senior High School.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="accountability">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Accountability.</h2>
      <p class="lede">We are asking people to trust us with their money. These are the details that let them check us.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards-2" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <article class="contact-card">
        <h3>Registration</h3>
        {% if site.registration and not site.registration.startsWith("[") %}<p>Registered in Ghana, registration number {{ site.registration }}.</p>{% else %}<p>Registration with the Registrar-General's Department and the Department of Social Welfare is in progress. We will publish the numbers here as soon as they are issued.</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      <article class="contact-card">
        <h3>Policies</h3>
        <p>Because we work with women, children in schools, elders and persons with disabilities, these must be in place.</p>
        <p><a class="link" href="/safeguarding/">Safeguarding policy</a><br>
           <a class="link" href="/privacy/">Privacy notice</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-note">
      <p><strong>{{ site.name }}</strong>, {{ site.addressLine1 }}, {{ site.addressLine2 }}, {{ site.addressLine3 }}. Executive: Madam Angela Ahimah, Founder and Chief Executive Officer.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h2>We give tools, not handouts.</h2>
      <p>Sanitary materials, food, medical care, and the equipment that makes a woman self-reliant.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="/donate/">Give today</a>
  </div>
</section>
